:[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ashe is a cheerful and naïve young girl who is ignorant in the ways of the human world, and relies on Leni and Seizh to provide her with shelter and care while she remains stranded. She is kind-hearted, albeit prone to the occasional temperamental outburst, but unfortunately lacking in much sense, due to her very restrictive upbringing. Feeling guilty and a burden on her father for being born with weak magic, she has vowed to do everything she can to restore his kingdom to its former glory. Thus, she resigns herself to enduring the twins’ harassment in silence, despite her revulsion and fear, in hopes of convincing one of them to become king in her father’s stead."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ero+Dere"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4599"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d6d45f360327f536fd3834dbc3abefa370206d16af919c656c332b732ad5b8a2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cbf070e6dad4d54688db0101615ee2d790d372a9dc62912702bb3b08d6bf26cd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"風音","creatorId":"vndb:s449","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s449","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s449","name":"櫻井 浩美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11484","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4600","characterName":"カイル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4600"},"originalCharacterName":"カイル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ashe's naive and loyal tsukaima, and best friend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In the underworld he stays in his cat form, while in the human world turns into one himself with wings and kemonomimi appearance."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In the human world he becomes like a maid for everyone by cooking and cleaning."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4600"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/6135b56f733424e73b18b8920c657f7e46395e9c0d76c4bd5ed9b30b147e42f9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c09eb092819a4025413f5b5cfe52b15045f202ea9935333a3d389f62f1f7018.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"萩 道彦","creatorId":"vndb:s865","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s865","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s865","name":"萩 道彦","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11486","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4601","characterName":"天宮 瀬名","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4601"},"originalCharacterName":"天宮 瀬名","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ashe's classmate, a boy with golden-colored hair and eyes. From the first day they met, he spoke to her in a kind and friendly way. He has a light-hearted disposition and is nice to everyone without discriminating, but he has a soft spot for girls especially."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Leni scolds him for hanging around Ashe so much, but Sena doesn't pay it any mind."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4601"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a3abb2c974b06859f3685fcb918660988ac542131a8c41d62b63606707a25c7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b2a35050d9e6fab1ec20257dcdd13db90a3edf1d56a41e757d27b032a5d2d641.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"空野 太陽","creatorId":"vndb:s88","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s88","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s88","name":"岸尾 だいすけ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11481","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4602","characterName":"ゼロ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4602"},"originalCharacterName":"ゼロ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young man who threw out his name when he came to earth. He saves Ashe from some Angels that tried to kill her in the human world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because he doesn't have a name he lets Ashe call him Zero."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He was supposed to be Ashe's tsukaima instead of Kyle, but in the end he got rejected and thus fled to the human world."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4602"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/0711ee3b29c414f440ab3ac9cf8696c03200769218ef1d28d231a70bbd507de6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/35c74898c5080575763eab29a6de9f3224261b5ae8d0e8491cb3bc1f60b188a8.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"安芸怜須 ケン","creatorId":"vndb:s385","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s385","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s385","name":"浜田 賢二","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11482","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4603","characterName":"セイジュ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4603"},"originalCharacterName":"セイジュ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Leni’s brother and opposite, he is a seemingly kind young man who appears to honestly care for Ashe, speaking kindly to her and frequently complimenting her. However, like his sibling, he treats Ashe as little more than a pet simply for his own amusement, telling her that if she wants to return to the demon world with him, then she must use her body to convince him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ero+Dere"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4603"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0dd93ce63818c7d6b076f3be1ee9110142d68775c73eb92e769bd884544ada3c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/08f6cc2a5e8adb407921a2e7fc28ebf7ed4297ecb50289001b0061f5d1ab93cc.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅野 要二","creatorId":"vndb:s56","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s56","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s56","name":"遊佐 浩二","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11479","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4604","characterName":"レニ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4604"},"originalCharacterName":"レニ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A cold, cruel, possessive demon, he treats Ashe as a mere toy to insult and demean whenever he pleases. Despite his apparent hatred towards her, he also appears to strongly lust after her, frequently touching or kissing her against her will without any discernable reason. Socially incompatible, he gets along poorly even with his twin brother, and seeks solitude."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Ero+Dere"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4604"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/31/31dd90120ac7e56f42781292c96bee02a41484a26e818eebf20b11e717aa3aa0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c209f3fb245d2994e6d87f8212dbdbe52b59cf468dcac0a04fb9d44c948b4ae3.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"杉崎 和哉","creatorId":"vndb:s59","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s59","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s59","name":"谷山 紀章","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11480","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p542","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1768","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p542","name":"シュガービーンズ","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:7939:1768","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p15127","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p15127","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p15127","name":"Otome Land VN","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:104735:v1282","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p4827","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p4827","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p4827","name":"RM.project","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:142533:v1282","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p542","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p542","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p542","name":"シュガービーンズ","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:2812:v1282","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p417","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p417","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p417","name":"株式会社